BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (  In the dawn of time, the Valley of Echoes was barren, save for the Garden of Dorian. Dorian he) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (    ld five stones of pure starlight, objects of immense potential. To keep them was to remain s) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (    tagnant, but to offer them to the River Spirit was to risk everything. With trembling hands,) Tj ET
