BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (    They learned that the multiplier of the universe favors the generous. To hoard is to shrink;) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (       to share is to expand the reach of the stars. In the dance of the gift, the void is fille) Tj ET
