BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (        dence of the orbit. She returned seven measures to the Sun, keeping eight for herself. U) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (        pon receiving the return, the Sun felt the warmth of reciprocity, and in the next cycle,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (         he cast more gold into the void. Thus, the Celestial Exchange was born-a rhythm of trus) Tj ET
