BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (      There was once a merchant who cast five coins into the Well. A partner stood waiting on th) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (        e other side. If the partner hoarded the fifteen coins, the Well would turn to lead, its) Tj ET
