BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (        remain stagnant, but to offer them to the River Spirit was to risk everything. With trem) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (        bling hands, Dorian cast the stones into the swirling currents of the central stream. Th) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (        e waters roared, magnifying the starlight into a glowing bounty that flooded the banks.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (      The River Spirit, bound by the ancient laws of reflection, caught the shimmering essence. ) Tj ET
