BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (         fifteen threads of light.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      "Trust," the Weaver whispered, handing over the five strands. "Use the loom with grace.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (      The Merchant, tempted by the glint of potential, could have claimed the fifteen threads fo) Tj ET
