BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (         the wealth, returning seven threads to the Weaver and keeping eight for the loom's main) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (        tenance. Because he chose honor over avarice, the loom sang, and the next day, the Weave) Tj ET
