BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (         fifteen threads of light.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      "Trust," the Weaver whispered, handing over the five strands. "Use the loom with grace.") Tj ET
