BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (      In the beginning, there were two spirits: Elara, the Giver, and Kael, the Keeper. Elara he) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (        ld a single golden seed, a spark of potential. She approached Kael, who stood upon the b) Tj ET
