BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (      Now, the harvest lay before Kael. If Kael buried the bounty, hoarding the riches alone, th) Tj ET
