BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (        would bring forth an even greater bounty. The balance of the world rested not on the see) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (        d itself, but on the bridge of reciprocity built between them. A single act of selfishne) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (        ss could wither a thousand branches, while a spirit of fairness ensured that the orchard) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (         bloomed forever. Thus, in the dance of the Giver and the Keeper, the prosperity of the ) Tj ET
