BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (        , returned seven and a half coins to the merchant. In this act of equilibrium, the Well ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (        sang, its waters turning to liquid starlight. This light warmed the entire valley, ensur) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (        ing that the next harvest brought even more silver to the Well. The game of the Well is ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (        a mirror; it demands a courage that defies the instinct to hoard. By acknowledging that ) Tj ET
