BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (         fifteen threads of light.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (      "Trust," the Weaver whispered, handing over the five strands. "Use the loom with grace.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (      The Merchant, tempted by the glint of potential, could have claimed the fifteen threads fo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (        r his own coffers. Yet, he sensed the heartbeat of the connection between them. He split) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 58.0 Td (         the wealth, returning seven threads to the Weaver and keeping eight for the loom's main) Tj ET
